					item: "sereneseasons:calendar"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 2.0d
			subtitle: "Welcome to the Waste Lands"
			tasks: [{
				id: "504F530000002001"
				title: "Read the memo"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "The World Has Moved On"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["504F530000001001"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0002: Reclamation Units]"
				""
				"Your kit holds one &bMk I Reclamation Generator&r. Set it down and it pulls cobblestone out of the void:"
				"slowly. Very slowly. NCP calls this 'sustainable'."
				"It needs no power at this grade. And no, NCP will not be issuing you a second one."
				""
				"&aRight-click&r it for a stack, &aleft-click&r for a single block. It holds what you don't take."
				"Later, a hopper or a pipe underneath keeps it empty while you're away."
				"&7Gravel, sand, dust, glass: all of it starts as this cobblestone. Treat it kindly."
			]
			id: "504F530000001002"
			rewards: [{
				count: 2
				id: "504F530000003002"
				item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Matter from nothing (slowly)"
			tasks: [{
				count: 64L
				id: "504F530000002002"
				item: "minecraft:cobblestone"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Reclamation Mk I"
			x: 3.0d
			y: -4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["504F530000001009"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0003: Hydration Policy]"
				""
				"You have a &bthirst&r bar. The island's spring never runs dry, but its water is &cdirty&r."
				"It looks clean. That's how it gets you."
				""
				"&aStep one:&r fill one of your new glass bottles at the spring (right-click the water with it): &cdirty water&r."
				"&7Don't drink it. NCP reminds you that dehydration is not covered by your contract, and neither is dysentery."
			]
			id: "504F530000001003"
			rewards: [{
				id: "504F530000003003"
				item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Thirst, part one"
			tasks: [{
				id: "504F530000002003"
				item: "toughasnails:dirty_water_bottle"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Water Is Life"
			x: 8.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["504F530000001003"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0012: Purification]"
				""
				"&aStep two:&r set the bottle of dirty water on the kiosk's old campfire. Half a minute later it's &bpurified&r."
				"Purified water is safe to drink. Boil a few. You'll be thirsty again sooner than you think."
				""
				"&7Later, a &bWater Purifier&7 does this much faster. It needs copper, so not today."
			]
			id: "504F53000000100D"
			rewards: [{
				count: 2
				id: "504F530000003012"
				item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Thirst, part two"
			tasks: [{
				count: 2L
				id: "504F53000000200F"
				item: "toughasnails:purified_water_bottle"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Boil It"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["504F530000001001"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0006: Food Security]"
				""
				"There's no farmland to spare on a floating rock, so we grow food in &bBotany Pots&r."
				""
				"&aHow:&r craft a pot, then claim the dirt below. Set the pot on solid ground, put the &bdirt&r in it, then a seed."
				"Wait. Right-click to harvest. Later, a &bhopper botany pot&r over a chest harvests on its own."
				""
				"&7Clay comes from dust (see Hammer Time): smelt a clay block into terracotta, and bake bricks for the flower pot."
				"&7Enclosed: one block of dirt and two seeds. Tomato seeds are 1 Scrip at the NCP Shop."
				"&7Don't dig up the island for more dirt."
				"&7The island is the only thing between you and a very long fall."
			]
			id: "504F530000001006"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "504F530000003022"
					item: "minecraft:dirt"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
