			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["504F53000000100B"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0013: Your First GregTech Tool]"
				""
				"Hammering gravel sometimes leaves a &bflint&r behind. Flint and stone (smelt cobblestone) make a &bflint mortar&r."
				"&7EMI shows the shape."
				""
				"The mortar grinds things in the crafting grid: gravel into flint, flint into flint dust, sand into quartz sand."
				"It wears out. Every GregTech operator keeps a spare, and every one of them learned why the hard way."
			]
			id: "504F53000000100E"
			rewards: [{
				id: "504F530000003013"
				item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
				type: "item"
			}]
