		{
			dependencies: [
				"504F53000000100E"
				"504F530000001008"
			]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0009: Glassworks]"
				""
				"Plain sand won't melt into clear glass here. GregTech makes glass the proper way:"
				"&asand&r + mortar = &bquartz sand&r; &aflint&r + mortar = &bflint dust&r; quartz sand + a little flint dust = &bglass dust&r."
				"Smelt the glass dust in a furnace and you get glass. Three glass in a V make three &bglass bottles&r."
				"&7Until you have bottles, crouch and drink straight from the spring. It's a gamble. Sometimes you lose."
				"&7No coal for a new campfire? Logs and sticks make a rough one."
			]
			id: "504F530000001009"
			rewards: [{
				count: 2
				id: "504F53000000300E"
				item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Sand, flint, fire, glass"
			tasks: [
