			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0010: Next Assignment]"
				""
				"You can drink, eat and reclaim matter. You are, officially, &aalive&r. Plenty of operators never got this far."
				"&7(Temperature and seasons are covered in the NCP Field Manual.)"
				""
				"Your next posting is &bRiver Crossing&r: the first powered machines, the first Clearance Card,"
				"and your first access to &bPositronic Memory&r. There's a road. It's mostly still there."
				""
				"&7From here on, the memos are mine. NCP stopped writing them a long time ago."
			]
